    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1997681662478664145",
      "url": "https://x.com/dost_pagasa/status/1997681662478664145",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/dost_pagasa/status/1997681662478664145",
      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 7 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Shear Line\nIssued at: 11:00 PM, 07 December 2025(Sunday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Quezon, Laguna(San Pablo, Alaminos, Cavinti, Majayjay, Famy, Paete, Lumban, Santa Maria, Mabitac, Pakil, Pangil, Siniloan, Kalayaan, Luisiana, Pagsanjan, Magdalena, Santa Cruz, Pila, Victoria, Calauan, Bay, Los Banos, Nagcarlan, Liliw, Rizal) and Rizal(Tanay, Jala-Jala, Pililla).\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, expect light to moderate with occasional heavy rains over Metro Manila, Cavite, Batangas and Bulacan(Angat, Balagtas, Bocaue, Meycauayan, San Jose del Monte, Marilao, Obando, Pandi, Santa Maria, Norzagaray, Dona Remedios Trinidad, Bulakan) within the next 3 hours.\nLight to moderate with occasional heavy rains affecting Rizal(Cardona, Binangonan, Teresa, Morong, Antipolo, Baras, Angono) and Laguna(Cabuyao, Calamba, Santa Rosa, Binan, San Pedro) which may persist within 3 hours and may affect nearby areas.\n\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 2:00 AM tomorrow.\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
